### ============================================
### MULTI-USER SCENARIOS
### ============================================

### Signup User 2
# @name signupUser2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "User Two",
  "phone": "+45 87654321"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("user2_token", response.body.token);
    client.global.set("user2_id", response.body.user.id);
    client.log("User 2 token: " + response.body.token);
%}

###

### Join Group (User 2 with invite code)
# @name joinGroup
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/join
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "{{invite_code}}"
}

###

### Join Group - invalid code (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/join
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "INVALID"
}

###

### Join Group - already member (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/join
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "{{invite_code}}"
}

###

### Get Group Members (User 2 - should see both members now)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{group_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}

###

### Get User 2's Groups (should include joined group)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}

###

### Leave Group (User 2)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{group_id}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}

###

### Leave Group - owner cannot leave (should fail)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{group_id}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Access Group - not a member (should fail after User 2 left)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{group_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}

