### ============================================
### VALIDATION TESTS
### ============================================

### Create Group - name too short (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "description": "Name too short"
}

###

### Create Group - name too long (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "This is a very long group name that exceeds one hundred characters and should be rejected by validation",
  "description": "Name too long"
}

###

### Get Group - invalid ID (should fail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ============================================
### EXPENSE MANAGEMENT TESTS
### ============================================

### Create Expense - Equal Split
# @name createExpense
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 320.0,
  "description": "Dinner at Marius Mom",
  "category": "Food",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("expense_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("Expense ID: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### Create Expense - Custom Split
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 500.0,
  "description": "Hotel booking",
  "category": "Accommodation",
  "splitType": "custom",
  "splits": [
    {
      "userId": {{user1_id}},
      "shareAmount": 300.0
    },
    {
      "userId": {{user2_id}},
      "shareAmount": 200.0
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get Group Expenses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/group/{{group_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Get Group Balances
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/group/{{group_id}}/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Delete Expense (only payer can delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/{{expense_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Create Expense - not a member (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 999,
  "amount": 100.0,
  "description": "Should fail",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

###

### Create Expense - negative amount (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": -50.0,
  "description": "Negative amount test",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

###

### Create Expense - custom split doesn't sum correctly (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 100.0,
  "description": "Bad split",
  "splitType": "custom",
  "splits": [
    {
      "userId": {{user1_id}},
      "shareAmount": 30.0
    },
    {
      "userId": {{user2_id}},
      "shareAmount": 50.0
    }
  ]
}

